- JUMP: [SPACE] / [W] / [UP ARROW]
- AIM: [MOUSE] 360 AIM (OR RIGHT STICK)
- SHOOT: [LEFT CLICK] / [X] (2 SHELLS)
- RECOIL JUMP: SHOOT DOWNWARD TO VAULT!
- RELOAD: [R] (AUTO-RELOADS WHEN DRY)
- PAUSE: [ESC] / [P]"

